{"id":"redsea24","name":"紅海航運危機升溫","date":"2024-01-12","cat":"geo","cat_name":"戰爭與地緣衝突","note":"繞道好望角，運費與運期上升","approx":true,"background":{"note":"繞道好望角，運費與運期上升","external":{"background":"葉門胡塞武裝攻擊紅海商船，船公司改繞好望角，蘇伊士運河通行量大減","notes":"兩個數字窗口不同（日曆年 vs 財年）且是埃及一國收入損失，兩者重疊，勿相加。非美元的一手指標：IMF PortWatch 顯示 2024 年 1–2 月通過蘇伊士的貿易量年減 50%、繞行好望角 +74%（IMF 部落格 2024-03-07：https://www.imf.org/en/blogs/articles/2024/03/07/red-sea-attacks-disrupt-global-trade）。全球層級的額外運輸成本找過 IMF、UNCTAD、World Bank、Kiel 都沒有權威總額；MDS Transmodal 的 $350 億是繞行貨物價值不是成本。埃及總統稱損失近 $70 億僅見二手摘要（AGBI），與官方 $62.6 億差約 $6 億，未採用。","headline":{"usd_bn":6.26,"kind":"realized_loss","what":"蘇伊士運河 2024 日曆年收入 $39.9 億，較 2023 年紀錄的 $102.5 億減少約 $62.6 億（−61%）；$62.6 億為兩個官方數字相減（埃及總理引述運河管理局）","source":"Arab News《Red Sea tensions slash Suez Canal revenue as Egypt pushes diplomatic path》（埃及總理 Madbouly 於運河管理局日引述）","url":"https://www.arabnews.com/node/2597453/amp"},"impacts":[{"what":"蘇伊士運河 2024 日曆年收入 $39.9 億，較 2023 年紀錄的 $102.5 億減少約 $62.6 億（−61%）；$62.6 億為兩個官方數字相減（埃及總理引述運河管理局）","usd_bn":6.26,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2025","source":"Arab News《Red Sea tensions slash Suez Canal revenue as Egypt pushes diplomatic path》（埃及總理 Madbouly 於運河管理局日引述）","url":"https://www.arabnews.com/node/2597453/amp","source_quality":"secondary","kind":"realized_loss"},{"what":"蘇伊士運河管理局 FY2023/24（至 2024-06）收入 $72 億，較前一年 $94 億減少約 $22 億（−23%）；通行船數 20,048 vs 25,911","usd_bn":2.2,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2024","source":"Maritime Executive《Suez Canal Revenue Dropped $2B Last Year Due to Red Sea Security Crisis》2024-07-18（引述運河管理局）","url":"https://maritime-executive.com/article/suez-canal-revenue-dropped-2b-last-year-due-to-red-sea-security-crisis","source_quality":"secondary","kind":"realized_loss"}]}},"pre":{"lag":null,"months":[{"m":"2023-01","n":13,"on":["carry_jgb","carry_jpy","inflation_ust10","inflation_curve","inflation_gold","fertilizer_ust3m","cycle_sox","cycle_twii","cycle_twd","curve_inv","dxy_down","spx_dd","rates_up"],"new":["inflation_gold","dxy_down"]},{"m":"2023-